<title>USA: BioSpecific says board oks buyback program.</title>
<headline>BioSpecific says board oks buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>LYNBROOK, N.Y. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioSpecifics Technologies Corp said Thursday its board of directors has authorized a repurchase program for up to 100,000 shares of its common stock through April 1998.</p>
<p>The company said it will determine the timing and terms of the repurchase based on market conditions.</p>
<p>The company said repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
